"custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T07:31:26-07:00","id":1103478,"title":"","content":"page 69<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Technomancers, being considered \u201cbanal\u201d in the eyes of<br /> the Fae, may not purchase this Merit. Even if they don\u2019t belong<br /> to the Technocratic Union, the presence of such mages is<br /> metaphysical poison to the Dreaming Ones. (See Changeling:<br /> The Dreaming for details about the effects of Glamour and<br /> Banality on changelings.) </div> </div> </div><br /> page 74<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As with the Merit: Faerie Affinity, this Merit is forbidden<br /> to technomancers of all kinds. Their Banality is too high to<br /> sustain this gift of the blood. </div> </div> </div>This doesn't line up with Banality in C20 At all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2715,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","user":"Lian","date":". 06-14-2017, 10:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T07:46:11-07:00","id":1103482,"title":"","content":"im willing to bet thats because M20 BoS was written 2 years before C20","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i57.tinypic.com/10r2rtu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions