> </div>Strange Days listed twice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Jason, the Storyteller<br /> -<br /> &quot;Old dreams become new again in the spring. This is where the nightmares are.&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1357-storyteller31","name":"Storyteller31","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1357_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T09:55:28-07:00","id":1103534,"title":"","content":"Minority Report is too. Just from that snippet right there. :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2430-kalinara","name":"kalinara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2430_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"582"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T10:14:09-07:00","id":1103541,"title":"","content":"Also from that snippet: The cartoon sequel to Ghostbusters was called The Real Ghostbusters, not The Original Ghostbusters.<br /> <br /> Unless of course you were referring to the original Filmation GhostBusters cartoon which featured a couple of humans and a gorilla facing off against an evil ghost wizard. Possibly still good inspiration for Mage, but it has nothing to do with the movies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":