and honestly Union Technocrats would still be incredibly Banal because of the reducing reality to controlled reproducible effect dynamics. That's still incredibly Banal. C20 changes only really changed things for non Union Technomancers. It's not that difficult to navigate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12419-vikinzer","name":"vikinzer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-15T07:50:34-07:00","id":1103809,"title":"","content":"Please keep this thread for errata and if you have a topic you want to discuss, spin it off to its own thread. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-15T13:14:31-07:00","id":1103891,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if this is an &quot;error&quot;, but there's lots of talk about the Technocrats having the ability to manufacture wonders, but no rules on how to build the thing doing the manufacturing. Is it basically just building a wonder that's got the spheres involved to ... make other wonders?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2802-dreamtide","name":"Dreamtide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-15T17:03:25-07:00","id":1104032,"title":"","content":"<b>Bookmarks: </b>The front and back covers are both labelled &quot;Blank Page&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-18T16:35:07-07:00","id":1105218,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Pg 208<br /> <br /> <br /> Strange Days listed twice. </div> </div> </div>as is Minority report.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3872-captain-america","name":"Captain America","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-18T21:52:33-07:00","id":1105285,"title":"","content":"Hello all,<br /> <br /> List of possible erratas: (will update if I find more)<br /> <br /> 1) Page 75<br /> Original: If Ryan *and* Sylvia cast an Effect that earns 10 points of Paradox, then both Ryan and Sylvia get 10 Paradox points each<br /> Suggestion: If Ryan *or* Sylvia cast an Effect that earns 10 points of Paradox, then both Ryan and Sylvia get 10 Paradox points each<br /> <br /> 2) Page 79<br /> Original: quite a bit more about it than *then* you do<br /> Suggestion: quite a bit more about it than you do<br /> <br /> 3) Page 129, 131 and other ones which may have it<br /> Original: When choosing a signature, pick an expressive one-word description *(preferably a verb)* that shows how the energy acts in that character\u2019s life. Good descriptions include words like Stabilizing, Sorrowful, Furious, Cheerful, Tempestuous, Reliable, Warlike, and so forth. <br /> Suggestion: shouldn't it be &quot;preferably adjectives&quot;?<br /> <br /> 4) Page 143<br /> Original: Sphere Rank x 7 - the Grimoire level<br /> Suggestion: Just clarify if the actual calculation is actually<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">- Sphere Rank x 7 - the Grimoire level; or<br /> - Sphere Rank x (7 - the Grimoire level)</div> possibly with some example to illustrate.<br /> <br /> 5) Page 151<br /> Original: exacting specifications, and a *trail*-and-error process <br /> Suggestion: exacting specifications, and a *trial*-and-error process <br /> <br /> 6) Page 198 (end of page)<br /> Original: music (normal format)<br /> Suggestion: <i>music </i>(italic format)<br /> <br /> 7) Page 217<br /> Original: left side, inside &quot;Disrespect&quot; brand, there is a number<br /> Suggestion: shouldn't be there<br /> <br /> 8) Page 36<br /> Original: &quot;Enemies eliminated&quot;, &quot;Wards eliminated&quot;<br /> Suggestion: &quot;Enemies p.62&quot;, &quot;Wards p.66 (now under Ward)&quot;<br /> <br /> 9) Page 160<br /> Original: Artifact/Invention are described as needing Prime 4. <br /> Suggestion: in &quot;How Do You DO That?&quot;, page 46, it describes as &quot;<i>At Prime 3, she can craft Artifacts, Periapts, temporary Talismans, and similar Wonders</i>&quot;. Suggestion here is to describe when an Artifact could be created using Prime 3 instead of 4, such as what was done with Charms (page 160, BoS): &quot;<i>Simple Charm = Prime 2 (appropriate energy), Prime 3 (any energy), or Prime 4 + Life 3 (living Charm) + Spheres in Wonder\u2019s Effects.</i>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13594-shivgorothar","name":"Shivgorothar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-22T14:50:19-07:00","id":1106743,"title":"","content":"page 205 - Theosophy - I'm guessing &quot;Regarde&quot; should be &quot;Regardie&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7061-azrael","name":"Azrael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7061_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}